Playwright Chromium sandbox seccomp profile

Source: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/blob/v1.62.1/utils/docker/seccomp_profile.json
Release: v1.62.1
Commit: 26a9e470a7b3c7822084b09fb7f13902c5f37b51
